# Pairs with NoSecretMaterial. The target id and detail of a denied call are
# built from the raw request before authorization; storing them unbounded lets
# an unauthorized caller make every denial persist and replicate arbitrary
# text.
MODULE: AuditCallerTextUnbounded
TARGET: NoSecretMaterial
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a denial record stores the caller's text unbounded
PERTURBS: Authorize

--- FIND
Row(o, "Denied", c, "caller", FALSE, FALSE)
--- REPLACE
Row(o, "Denied", c, "caller", FALSE, TRUE)
--- END
